# ============================================================
#  Arcs (design §10.6): the main plot and character arcs as data.
#  acts: name@year · clock: range · beats: clock@yNmM (the clock
#  advances on schedule whatever the player does) · clues: what can
#  be found · key_clues: needed for the finale, each with ≥ 2
#  sources. Mechanics arrive in phase 2b; the structure in phase 3.
# ============================================================

@arc hollowstar
name: The Hollow Star
canon: hard
acts: omens@y1 investigation@y2 escalation@y3 convergence@y4
clock: 0..12
beats: 1@y1m3 2@y1m9 4@y2m2 5@y2m9 7@y3m2 8@y3m7 10@y4m3 12@y4m9
clues: founders_ledger lake_bell second_shadow seven_locks star_key kael_family ilse_truth knows_founders_seal heard_of_starcalling codex_names
key_clues: seven_locks star_key ilse_truth
cast: kael ilse isolde maud seraphine
desc: Something that eats light sleeps beneath the Mirror Lake, behind a door the founders sealed with seven locks. Someone wants it open.

@arc lyra_and_her_mother
name: Second Place
canon: hard
acts: rivals@y1 cracks@y2 choice@y3
clock: 0..6
clues: black_seal_letters
cast: lyra
desc: Lyra Vaneshade has never once heard "well done". Her rivalry with you can become respect, friendship or more, and her mother will have something to say about all three.

@arc kael_thaw
name: Thaw
canon: hard
acts: frost@y1 trust@y2 thaw@y3
clock: 0..6
clues: kael_family
cast: kael
desc: Kael Dumont was sent to open a door and came to stop it. Whether he manages depends on whether anyone is warm enough.

@arc ilse_dumont
name: The Girl in White Furs
canon: hard
acts: arrival@y2 the_man_in_grey@y3 north@y4
clock: 0..6
clues: ilse_truth
cast: ilse kael
desc: Kael's sister was raised by the Hollow cult to do what he wouldn't. The man in grey wants her home. She might let him.
